Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要决斗了……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗！小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然很可疑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，那家伙可是一次都没赢过我的游马啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可最近那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗不是一直在赢吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:00:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？那有什么不对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:01:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天就该输了才配得上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么叫输了才配得上……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然那个叫星光体的家伙真的存在吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.91,0:01:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯——……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟——！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，早上好，游……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一脸奇怪的表情。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.01,0:01:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜啊～！我已经忍不住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊游马 对别人的穿衣品味{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然我觉得不该
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说三道四啦～！ 昨天也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前天也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再之前也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早啊！

Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那身打扮大家都在笑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了！？ 到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看看啊！ 你自己那副样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这什么鬼啊～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你自己都没自觉吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我怎么知道啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊！？ 这身打扮！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是这件事！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最近的游马净是些奇怪的事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知为何 便当变得越来越豪华了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}考试还拿了 100分{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且昨天更是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 一飞冲天 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.10,0:02:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 在搞什么啊！？ 那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是啥啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～ 哇啊～ 谁来阻止他啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 好像 他被人整得很惨来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是谁 干出那种事的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一直都被看着呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}昨天也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.31,0:02:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晚上还进了你的房间在做些什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！ 既然察觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么不告诉我啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又没被要求告诉你。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也在你的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算有别人在也不奇怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很奇怪好吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！既然如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要把犯人揪出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你鼓起干劲那身打扮也太……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是喜欢才穿成这样的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢！游马你本来就没啥穿衣品味。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你自己又怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，说不定比游马还好点哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！那行啊那就让我见识见识啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊！乐意之至！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就下周日我来帮你挑衣服。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}购物中心 下午3点 行吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！绝对不许迟到哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道啦！

Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢只有你们呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会关心我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有这孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这孩子啊想要夺走我重要的东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偷腥猫 观月小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 好好记住这孩子的脸。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。你们就是猎物哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫啊 可是会把小鸟什么的吃掉的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～真是的挑衣服挑着挑着就迟到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了，要迟到了。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～。喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～，已经这么晚了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊，小鸟那家伙。

Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有种让人脊背发凉的声音发出来。

Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？难道说你这家伙，怕猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是还没对观察结果做出反应而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就来告诉你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都说猫的灵感很强{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定它能看见你呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它好像把视线投向你这边了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？这条缎带。是小鸟的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？你说你收留了小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《小鸟……》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！

Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么地方。猫、猫、猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎您的到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是凯西。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯西？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。叫我小猫咪就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。她的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？她总是从远处注视着游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～说起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是搞不懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系。我习惯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起这个，小鸟在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要干这种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是你的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.61,0:08:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少废话，把小鸟还回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用担心，我会还给你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你在决斗中赢过我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，要是我赢了。呵呵，啊呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙，难道是 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果真是这样的话这场决斗，只能赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用你说我也会赢。决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫冲直撞。先攻就由我拿下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡 猫招来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 一上来就发动魔法卡吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将弃猫加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动永续魔法 猫集会。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来只要条件凑齐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能无数次发动魔法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我将 弃猫酱以攻击表示召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由此 发动猫集会的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:10:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫集会在弃猫酱被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将更多的弃猫酱召唤出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为啥啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力100的怪兽不管叫出来多少{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也成不了什么气候啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡　回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请　随你攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《小鸟我绝对会救你的》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞　我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤阿查查弓手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查弓手召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟敢把我的心脏射穿啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别说些莫名其妙的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来我要攻击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等游马，那家伙的目标是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.49,0:11:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿恰？阿恰？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么犹豫了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就选那边的弃猫吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？那这边。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，果然还是这边？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～到底是哪边！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只猫猫都在对我说快攻击我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是罪孽深重的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弃猫酱以表侧攻击表示在场地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你无法攻击弃猫酱以外的对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，呃……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你似乎陷入了困境啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只怪兽都是同样的弃猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算选择其中一方另一方的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“不能攻击弃猫以外的怪兽”也会被卡住{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果哪边都攻击不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…小鸟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！到底该怎么办…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 要摆脱这个局面有一个办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是说了让你闭嘴吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用我这份力量绝对要把小鸟救出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 你等着。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你正在和我决斗呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 我好像明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 翻转翻转。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以改变 场上一只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表示形式。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将左边的弃猫改为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 阿查查弓箭手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击右边的弃猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 只要将其中一只弃猫改为守备表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弃猫的效果就会消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能攻击剩下的攻击表示的弃猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能想到这种战术。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和平时的小马不一样》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救你的，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你眼里只有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个女人，而不是眼前的我？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不许你把视线从我身上移开。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我一直看着我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可以在对方战斗时发动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 怪猫变化！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在弃猫被战斗破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动从卡组 手牌 墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤1只化猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化、化猫！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这只化猫出现时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你场上的等级4以下的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后每有1只被破坏的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:14:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予你８００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份炽热的思念你为什么就是察觉不到呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！我把１张卡盖伏……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动化猫的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１回合１次可以从卡组或墓地选１只弃猫{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从卡组召唤弃猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵喵喵喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上存在３只等级１的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗？No.怪兽……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来就来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将２只等级１的弃猫和化猫叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤　出来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双尾猫娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵呜～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么　不用 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双尾猫娘的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次通过使用超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等…　等一下啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元还有2个呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全用了的话　呃～…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加上1600　就是3400。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3400！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恕我失礼了　呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说　她是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊　喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺能干的嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎… 那 那么… 猫猫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要让你 彻底迷上我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法是将世界 将战斗的舞台改变{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我创造出的世界猫猫世界 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 这 这是什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:16:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是猫的乐园 我和猫以及 只属于你的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在猫猫世界的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫猫们的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会上升其原本攻击力的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻… 攻击力２８００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马在看着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 双马尾猫女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把游马迷得神魂颠倒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 开启！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妖精之钟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在受到直接攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把名字带有妖精的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！妖精乔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵… 好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～ 好厉害啊 好厉害 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真… 真的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:16:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那只是在这个决斗的世界里而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行的 在现实中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦站到那个人面前就什么都说不出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个人根本没注意到我。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个过分的家伙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管对那个人施了多少魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他都没有回过头来看我。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以至少，能在那个人喜欢的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗里和他保持联系就好了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接说出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事直接干脆地说出来不就好了嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要放弃不管多少次都要一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一飞冲天哦，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要告白。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.42,0:17:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对你……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动木桩栗子的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌的松果球送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤木槌球！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}木槌～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 被送去墓地的松果球的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡从手牌送去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}墓地时 可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也用3只怪兽 超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.79,0:18:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级1的妖精 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}木槌球 松果球进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽 构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.21,0:18:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！ 现身吧 宝贝龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我将我我我魔术师以攻击表示召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！ 哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到结束阶段 可以改变等级！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.75,0:18:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 我我我魔术师变成等级１！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动宝贝虎龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用１个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以用我场上的１只等级１怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 听我说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击 我我我魔术！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵喵喵喵喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}气氛高涨起来了～！ 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用宝贝虎龙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击双尾猫娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 那样攻击力不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦 别担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.61,0:19:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动速攻魔法 虚荣巨影！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让１只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅限战斗期间 提升１０００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 宝贝虎龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…对游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 虚荣巨影的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与宝贝虎龙战斗的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变回原本的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马…喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 宝贝虎龙！宝贝激流！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:20:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫 喵什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 不是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 告诉我小鸟在哪里吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪摔倒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵 好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫咪摔倒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:21:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小……小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你在搞什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎嘿嘿嘿……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说嘛，是猫咪们缠着我说陪我玩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也没办法呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，你要气到什么时候啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才没生气！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看，明明就在生气。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……早上好……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃，你是谁来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，真没礼貌。那孩子是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们班上的……呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯西·猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙决斗很厉害的哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？嘿……嘿哎，我都不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来对游马恶作剧的犯人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那个完全搞不懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我先走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:21:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:22:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果 其之十一。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来游马还是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法理解女性的心情啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.15,0:22:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.67,0:22:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本周的问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.37,0:22:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌发动的是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.68,0:22:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡？还是陷阱卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.27,0:24:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.31,0:24:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡可以从手牌使用
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.50,0:24:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是非常方便的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记住它吧！

Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.36,0:23:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说那家伙跟一帮危险分子混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.39,0:23:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们回去吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.97,0:23:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么，为什么要放弃决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又要和那个少年战斗吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.81,0:23:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…你别跟那种家伙混在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.09,0:23:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我不用 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会赢，然后把你送回原来的世界！！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下集 游戏王ZEXAL 逆袭的鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.33,0:24:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧啊啊啊啊！我！！

